These are bad medical games,

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:06.700
like really bad, embarrassingly
bad one-star games.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.760
Click that to check me playing them.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:10.880
Checking me playing them?
Check me out playing them.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.688
And as always, stay happy and healthy.

